</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_e77e4b4a-72f4-9bfd-a0d8-1a87079bf846" id="_e77e4b4a-72f4-9bfd-a0d8-1a87079bf846"></a>January 2019</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_26c42665-23fe-b824-b9de-7bff15393982" id="_26c42665-23fe-b824-b9de-7bff15393982"></a>S-121PT</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_b0510e82-879e-bfbc-fc97-87ed16397d51" id="_b0510e82-879e-bfbc-fc97-87ed16397d51"></a>Minor revision after S-121 Project Team meeting December 2017, including , the addition of the code list &#x201C;Interpolation Type&#x201D; in Fig 3 Section 3.1. and the addition of an information object &#x201C;S121_AdditionalSpatialInformationType&#x201D;  to support alignment with the S-100 Spatial Attribute.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_6e9e0796-3c20-e4aa-b2ab-1433217f147a" id="_6e9e0796-3c20-e4aa-b2ab-1433217f147a"></a>Ballot version of Edition 1.0.0</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_40ca45b0-e32d-3115-2155-08e7042ba116" id="_40ca45b0-e32d-3115-2155-08e7042ba116"></a>February 2019</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_d8a20382-4739-b5ff-f0af-7ef2bd5f9eb4" id="_d8a20382-4739-b5ff-f0af-7ef2bd5f9eb4"></a>IHO Sec</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_2ce25fba-ed30-5eb8-b464-952f6d7857f8" id="_2ce25fba-ed30-5eb8-b464-952f6d7857f8"></a>Revised format and structure.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_afc8994e-936d-f948-2ed5-bdccd3aaa2c8" id="_afc8994e-936d-f948-2ed5-bdccd3aaa2c8"></a>Edition 1.0.0</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_de0a5cb9-1ce9-d886-2a2b-55ad35dc0253" id="_de0a5cb9-1ce9-d886-2a2b-55ad35dc0253"></a>October 2019</p>
