</td></tr><tr><th valign="top" align="left" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><b>Permitted Primitives:</b></th><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_9dfa7509-ad26-f41b-34a4-55c96cc3619d" id="_9dfa7509-ad26-f41b-34a4-55c96cc3619d"></a>P,L,A</p>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
