</td></tr><tr><th valign="top" align="left" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;"><b>Reference</b></th><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_952e3123-15ec-7d90-dc58-0cdf77e011f6" id="_952e3123-15ec-7d90-dc58-0cdf77e011f6"></a>ISO 19152</p>
